    Engineering Team Lead focused on platform, identity, and reliability. I ship boring‑by‑default, idiomatic
    systems that raise delivery velocity and cut cost.
  </p>

  <!-- At‑a‑glance facts (minimal, evergreen) -->
  <ul>
    <li>Location: Berlin (hybrid, 99% remote)</li>
    <li><strong>Focus:</strong> Identity & Platform · Reliability · Security</li>
    <!-- Optional later: Languages / Work authorization / Availability -->
  </ul>

  <section aria-labelledby="exp">
    <h2 id="exp">Experience</h2>

    <!-- Current role -->
    <article aria-labelledby="etl-platform">
      <header>
        <h3 id="etl-platform">Engineering Team Lead (Platform)</h3>
