          <time datetime="2022-10">Oct 2022</time>
          <span aria-hidden="true">–</span>
          <time>Present</time>
          · Berlin (hybrid, 99% remote)
        </p>
        <p>
          Lead platform modernization and reliability. Restarted stalled delivery, restored core systems, and
          embedded lasting service ownership.
        </p>
      </header>

      <p>Joined as Senior Software Engineer; promoted to Engineering Team Lead (Platform) in July 2024.</p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          Restarted delivery after months of zero output; raised production deploys to ~15/month on regulated,
          QA-heavy services.
        </li>
        <li>
          Cut CI test suite time by 33% (wall‑clock) and 13% (billable), saving significant developer hours
          and reducing compute cost.
        </li>
        <li>
          Reduced memory usage in the core Rails app by ~70% via YJIT & jemalloc tuning and targeted
          allocation fixes, allowing to save running-cost by resource downscale.
        </li>
        <li>
          Removed scaling bottlenecks (SQL DML/DDL, read‑replica–safe patterns, PostgreSQL config) through
          production profiling and query optimization; shipped efficient Ruby/Rails paths.
        </li>
        <li>
          Scaled core platform services—identity & access (IDM), authentication/authorization, and HLS video
          delivery—a revenue-critical capability—improving security posture and reliability.
        </li>
        <li>
          Established clear service ownership via a squad ownership model, improving accountability and
          on‑call clarity.
        </li>
        <li>
          Led engineering inputs for first ISO/IEC 27001 audit—certified with zero non‑conformities; authored
          and refined SOPs. (<a
            href="https://www.iso.org/isoiec-27001-information-security.html"
            target="_blank"
            rel="external nofollow noopener"
            aria-label="ISO/IEC 27001 — official overview (opens in a new tab)">ISO/IEC 27001 overview</a
          >)
        </li>
        <li>
          Hired and onboarded 2 engineers; coach a 3‑person team; drive cross‑squad alignment on IDM and video
